sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Streamlit
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Store as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    participant Model as Local model adapters
    UI->>API: Create session
    UI->>API: Upload PDF/DOC/DOCX (multipart)
    API->>API: Validate, extract pages, split chunks
    API->>Model: Embed chunks in bounded batches
    API->>Store: Transactionally commit metadata, text and vectors
    API-->>UI: Per-file ready/error/warning statuses
    UI->>API: Question + selected ready document IDs
    API->>API: Resolve named sources and recorded-data eligibility
    API->>Store: Retrieve scoped chunks and bounded same-page neighbors
    API->>API: Enumerate exact excerpts and project requested text-coordinate table cells
    API->>Model: Question + server-owned evidence items and separate supporting quotes
    Model-->>API: Structured excerpt-ID selections
    API->>API: Check coverage/provenance; retain exact table fields
    API->>Model: Selected prose only: draft concise paraphrases
    Model-->>API: Evidence IDs + proposed text
    API->>API: Check numbers, units, entities, negation and qualifications
    API->>Model: Check support/completeness against exact quotes
    Model-->>API: Structured support checks
    API->>API: At most one repair; attach original quotes and physical-page citations
    API-->>UI: Cited answer or insufficient-evidence response
